        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Navuzwa Yahova yambihilira kigira avandu munyi kandi si yaali anyala kumbuliriza mba. Muvogono yivwo, Yahova yambolera, ‘Yago gaduuki! Utativula makuva yaga mba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zia kondongozi kwi kiguru cha Pisiga ma ohenze ivaale kandi isavaalu, ivugwi kandi imadioli. Ohenze vulahi ligali ku icha ololaa, kigira si ulambuka mugera gwa Jorodani mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohe Joshua amalago geege. Muluvirizi kandi muleminyi mwoyo gwigwe ku lienya lilie; kigira alimilira avandu yava vaambuki kuzia kuvugura kivala cha ivi olola kila.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
